WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.500
One run built three fetchers.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:08.000
So the same page was fetched twice.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.800
The requests we do not send are theirs.

4
00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:15.800
A hit sends nothing, so nothing is skipped.

5
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:19.500
Only a page we were allowed is stored.

6
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:22.700
Bounded in bytes, not in pages.

7
00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:26.500
And it reports when it was really read.

8
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:30.200
There is no socket test, deliberately.

9
00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:32.400
The request we do not send.
